=== Single-level inheritance ===
Rex is a German Shepherd, age 5
  Name: Rex
  Age: 5
  Breed: German Shepherd
=== Multi-tier inheritance (3 levels) ===
Buddy is a Labrador guide dog, age 3, handler: Alice
  Name: Buddy
  Age: 3
  Breed: Labrador
  Handler: Alice
=== Subtype assignability ===
Passing Dog to method accepting Animal:
  Animal info: Rex (age 5)
Passing GuideDog to method accepting Animal:
  Animal info: Buddy (age 3)
=== Base constructor chaining ===
Base Animal: Cat (age 8)
Dog via base chain: Max (age 1)
GuideDog via base chain: Luna (age 2)
Done!
